===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*lendʰ- (loin)}}
{{bor+|en|la-new|lumbāris}}, from {{m|la|lumbus|t=loin}} + {{m|la|-āris}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''adj.'' and ''n.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=1064475135}}</ref> See {{m|en|loin}}.

